# {{.Name}}

A [fullstack](https://github.com/shibisty/fullstack.go) application: Go's `net/http` and
`html/template`, SQLite through orm, users with registration and login (passport), migrations,
seeders and HTTP tests.

```bash
gtr install
cp .env.example .env          # Windows: copy .env.example .env
go run . migrate              # or keep DB_MIGRATE=true in .env
go run . db:seed              # demo@example.com / password
gtr run dev                   # http://localhost:8080
gtr run test
```

## Layout

| | |
|---|---|
| `main.go` | serves HTTP, or runs a console command (`go run . list`) |
| `bootstrap/app.go` | the App and its providers |
| `routes/web.go`, `routes/api.go` | the routes |
| `app/http/controllers` | the handlers |
| `app/models` | the models (orm) |
| `app/users` | registering and checking users |
| `app/providers` | service providers |
| `database/migrations`, `database/seeders` | the schema and the data |
| `resources/views` | layouts, partials and pages (`html/template`, embedded in the binary) |
| `tests` | HTTP tests on an in-memory database |

## Console

```bash
go run . list
go run . routes:list
go run . make:model Post -m          # the model and its migration
go run . make:controller Post
go run . make:migration add_title_to_posts_table
go run . migrate:status
go run . migrate:rollback
go run . db:seed
```

## Configuration

`.env` (see `.env.example`): `APP_*`, `HTTP_*`, `LOG_*`, `DB_DRIVER` / `DATABASE_DSN`, `AUTH_*`.
Variables set in the environment win over `.env`.
